    {
      "text": "Fill a cocktail shaker with ice; add ½ cup watermelon purée, ⅛ cup lemon vodka, 1 tablespoon lime juice, and ½ tablespoon triple sec. Cover and shake until the outside of the shaker has frosted. Strain into a martini glass. Repeat process for remaining martinis.",
